<div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;max-width:560px;margin:auto;color:#0f172a">
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:4px">Your account is approved</h2>
  <p>Hello {{ name }},</p>
  <p>An administrator approved your {{ app_name }} account.</p>
  <p>Your temporary password:</p>
  <p style="font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:18px;background:#f1f5f9;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;display:inline-block">{{ temp_password }}</p>
  <p><a href="{{ link }}" style="display:inline-block;background:#0f172a;color:#fff;padding:10px 18px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none">Sign in</a></p>
  <p style="font-size:13px;color:#475569">You will be asked to choose your own password right after your first sign-in. Delete this e-mail once you have.</p>
</div>
